{
 "id": 1801792,
 "titulo": "11/21 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1700535619445,
 "modificada": 1755579469601,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1801792",
 "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1700532932049\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a3dcbba583c045b8a5a5dbe0912fe81e_1700532932049_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Meet the hero who keeps challenging<br>\nto solve the problem with the Timeline!&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Loki </span>has gained the powerful authority to deal with time&nbsp;<br>\nwith his new Uniform and Tier-4 Advancement.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">And, the new Super Hero who fights for freedom and revenge,<br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Sylvie</span>, who is similar to but different from Loki has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated heroes<br>\nby downloading the 11/21 Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">■ 11/21 Patch Details</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 11/22 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 11/21 (Tue) 19:00 (PST)&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[11/22 (Wed) 2:55&nbsp;(UTC+0), 11/21 (Tue) 18:55&nbsp;(PST) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed as of 11/22&nbsp;(Wed) 2:52 (UTC+0), 11/21&nbsp;(Tue) 18:52 (PST).&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances&nbsp;<br>\nand the </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ One New Hero</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The other Loki, Sylvie has been added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The hero skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1503\" id=\"1700533023390\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/4aa9c37c8517497aaea621fd2069fc13_1700533023390_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ One New Uniform</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">One new Uniform Loki &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ Loki</em>&gt;&nbsp;<br>\ninspired by Marvel Studios’ <em>Loki Season 2 </em>has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The new Uniform can be purchased after the 11/21 Patch data has been applied.<br>\n* The new Uniforms can be found and purchased in the Marvel Universe and the Uniform Room.<br>\n* The skill effects are based on Lv.10&nbsp;stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1355\" id=\"1700534633294\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/ce7eb66ec3084e6dbc7a79676885cde4_1700534633294_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Loki Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Loki is now available for Tier-4 Advancement.<br>\nCheck out the power of the god who revives countlessly to accomplish his goal.</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"302\" id=\"1700533099762\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7bdc07d478164a9ea25f5b04779cb969_1700533099762_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Sylvie Tier-3</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Sylvie is now available for Tier-3 Advancement.<br>\nCheck out the power of another god who fights for freedom and revenge.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"378\" id=\"1700533119331\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/c78733d687dc4991abb46968b85913df_1700533119331_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1700533119343\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/2be9b07047c042859439860c9a9bec80_1700533119343.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ New Artifact</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">New Artifacts for Loki and Sylvie have been added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"565\" id=\"1700533743001\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/5fa756df5d144a50b71b9ee53caabf22_1700533743001_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Game Error Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Some dialogues of Nick Fury in Legendary Battle: Masters of Light&nbsp;<br>\nbeing translated wrongly in particular languages has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. M.O.D.O.K.’s HP gauge being displayed in grey occasionally&nbsp;<br>\nin the second appearance at Story Ultimate 6-1 has been fixed.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1700533174908\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/06f8b06686224a82ba2c00988dc4fc2d_1700533174908_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
}